WEBVTT

00:11:29.053 --> 00:11:31.918
there are these things
called "nicotinic receptors."

00:11:32.929 --> 00:11:34.404
They're there ...

00:11:34.428 --> 00:11:35.592
waiting.

00:11:35.945 --> 00:11:39.207
They're waiting for, in the words
of that Philip Morris document,

00:11:39.231 --> 00:11:41.297
the next "dose unit of nicotine."

00:11:43.252 --> 00:11:45.918
The smoker that you see outside,

00:11:45.942 --> 00:11:47.831
huddled with other smokers,

00:11:47.855 --> 00:11:49.339
in the cold,

00:11:49.363 --> 00:11:50.625
in the wind,

00:11:50.649 --> 00:11:52.342
in the rain,

00:11:52.366 --> 00:11:54.620
is experiencing craving

00:11:54.644 --> 00:11:57.342
and may be experiencing
the symptoms of withdrawal.

00:11:58.564 --> 00:12:02.125
Those symptoms of withdrawal
are a chemical message